{
    "title": "ATM Instant Cash\u2122 & Rewards",
    "description": "ATM.com helps you earn money from: your data, playing games, answering paid surveys, sharing your location, cashback and bonus reward offers; while also providing personal finance budgeting tools and quick access to cash when you need it most. You can earn rewards and cash back from over 500 verified partners that can help you save money on your monthly expenses, improve your credit score, and more. Earn extra cash that you can withdraw directly to your bank account, not points, not gift cards, cash rewards! Get started by downloading the ATM.com app and start earning today.\r\n\r\nBeyond earning rewards, ATM Personal Finance puts you in the driver\u2019s seat of your money. It\u2019s bundled with ATM Instant Cash\u2122 - your financial lifeline for unexpected expenses - plus smart spend tracking and budgeting tools all in one place. Track your spending month over month and visualize by category or merchant for valuable cashflow insights. Tighten up your finances with customizable budgets, setting limits overall or per category. Keep tabs on upcoming bills and easily identify unwanted or duplicate subscriptions.\r\n\r\nATM Instant Cash\u2122 provides you with quick access cash. It allows you to cover unexpected expenses with no credit check, no interest, and no late fees. You can access cash advance limits ranging from $25 to $200*. Avoid overdraft fees and manage emergency expenses efficiently.  *Eligibility is based on review and approval. Not all applicants will be eligible for ATM Instant Cash\u2122. Transfer fees may apply.\r\n\r\nPlay and Earn!\r\n\r\nUsers are earning up to $250 a month by playing games found on ATM. Earnings can range from $3 up to $250, and your earnings depend on how much you play. We\u2019re working hard to find you more games to earn from and grow your money. If you\u2019re a gamer, this is a great way to find side hustles to earn more money from.\r\n\r\nRewards Portal\r\n\r\nThere are over 500 offers for users to earn from. Earn from $1 up to $500. Our rewards portal is an easy way to grow your money.\r\n\r\nDaily Rewards\r\n\r\nYou can earn every single day by coming back and answering a few questions! In fact nearly a million users have answered questions and you can earn in less than a minute. Try it out and earn daily at no cost to you!\r\n\r\nPaid Surveys\r\n\r\nNew surveys are added weekly and users earn anywhere from $0.03 up to $5.00 for each survey they complete. Most surveys take a few minutes and our users love using them as a side hustle. This is a great way to earn more cash and not gift cards or points.\r\n\r\nLocation Rewards\r\n\r\nUsers can earn daily by sharing their locations and walking into stores. Unlike earning from surveys, games, and rewards portal offers, users earn passively from location rewards. Enable Location Rewards when you install ATM and earn cash passively.\r\n\r\nDISCLOSURES\r\nDisclosures are available at https://atm.com/legal-disclaimers/\r\n\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/atmapp/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/atmdotcom/\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/atmdotcom?lang=en\r\nWebsite: https://www.atm.com/",
